%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#f97316', 'edgeLabelBackground': '#fef3c7'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 User (Mobile)
    participant App as 📱 Mobile App
    participant IDB as 💾 IndexedDB (Dexie)
    participant Sync as 🔄 Sync Engine
    participant API as 🚀 API
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as ⚙️ Workers

    User->>App: Create contact (offline)
    App->>IDB: INSERT contact (optimistic)
    App->>User: ✅ Immediate feedback
    App->>Sync: queueMutation(contactos, id, 'create', payload)
    Sync->>IDB: INSERT pendingMutations
    alt Online
        Sync->>API: POST /api/contactos
        API->>DB: INSERT contact
        DB-->>API: contact_id
        API-->>Sync: 201 + server_id
        Sync->>IDB: DELETE mutation + UPDATE contact (server_id)
    else Offline
        Sync->>User: ⏳ Queued for sync
    end
    
    %% Later: Background Sync
    Sync->>API: GET /api/contactos?since=lastSync
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM contactos WHERE updatedAt > since
    DB-->>API: server_changes
    API-->>Sync: server_changes
    Sync->>IDB: Upsert batch (upsertBatch)
    Sync->>IDB: UPDATE syncMetadata (lastSync)
    Sync->>App: Real-time update (liveQuery)
    App->>User: 🔄 Synced silently